## Dataset - Structured Data Handling
Dataset provides a powerful way to work with structured data:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
## Dataset - Structured Data Handling
Dataset provides a powerful way to work with structured data:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
ds = Dataset[{
  <|"name" -> "Alice", "age" -> 25, "score" -> 92|>,
  <|"name" -> "Bob", "age" -> 30, "score" -> 87|>,
  <|"name" -> "Charlie", "age" -> 22, "score" -> 95|>,
  <|"name" -> "Diana", "age" -> 28, "score" -> 89|>
}]

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
(*VB[*)(FrontEndRef["ff6da284-3117-443d-9e1d-cb9df0df27fc"])(*,*)(*"1:eJxTTMoPSmNkYGAoZgESHvk5KRCeEJBwK8rPK3HNS3GtSE0uLUlMykkNVgEKp6WZpSQaWZjoGhsamuuamBin6FqmGqboJidZpqQZpKQZmaclAwCIkhY6"*)(*]VB*)

